            "min": 2,
            "max": 5,
            "value": 3,
            "step": 1,
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Shape parameter",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ],
        "readouts": [],
        "note": {
          "en": "Equation: <b id=\"conicEq\" class=\"mono\">x²/16 + y²/9 = 1</b>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 8.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Give the centre and radius of \\( (x-2)^{2}+(y+3)^{2}=16 \\).</p><p>Standard circle form \\( (x-h)^{2}+(y-k)^{2}=r^{2} \\):</p>\\[ \\text{centre } (2,-3),\\qquad r=4. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 8.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the vertices of \\( \\dfrac{x^{2}}{16}-\\dfrac{y^{2}}{9}=1 \\).</p><p>The \\( x^{2} \\) term is positive, so the branches open left/right with \\( a=4 \\):</p>\\[ (\\pm 4,\\,0). \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Conic sections",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Conics are curves formed by intersecting a plane with a double cone: circles, ellipses, parabolas, and hyperbolas.</p>",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Circle",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( (x-h)^2+(y-k)^2=r^2 \\), centre \\( (h,k) \\), radius \\( r \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Ellipse",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{(x-h)^2}{a^2}+\\dfrac{(y-k)^2}{b^2}=1 \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Parabola",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( y=a(x-h)^2+k \\) or \\( x=a(y-k)^2+h \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Hyperbola",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{x^2}{a^2}-\\dfrac{y^2}{b^2}=1 \\); asymptotes \\( y=\\pm\\dfrac{b}{a}x \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Identify \\( 4x^2+9y^2=36 \\) and find its semi-axes.</p>\\[ \\frac{x^2}{9}+\\frac{y^2}{4}=1 \\implies a=3,\\;b=2.\\text{ Ellipse.} \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "question": {
          "en": "Write \\(9x^2+4y^2-36x+8y+4=0\\) in standard form and identify the conic.",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "Complete the square: \\(9(x-2)^2+4(y+1)^2=36\\Rightarrow\\dfrac{(x-2)^2}{4}+\\dfrac{(y+1)^2}{9}=1\\). Ellipse, centre \\((2,-1)\\), \\(a=3\\), \\(b=2\\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
